			"notes": "## Changed\n- Updated for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ / Fabric API 0.161.0+; NeoForge `26.3.0.7-beta`+). Requires Minecraft 26.3. Jade and Mod Menu integrations bumped to their 26.3 builds.\n\n## Fixed\n- Ported to the 26.3 APIs: block codecs (removed from the game), the bucket-swap inventory call (tanks, sprinkler, siphon), the item-spin transform in the Autocrafter and Mending Station renderers, and the 26.3 resource/data pack formats. No behaviour changes.\n\n## Notes\n- NeoForge for 26.3 is still in **beta**; this build targets `26.3.0.7-beta`.\n- No world or config changes. Every block, cluster, tank, pipe network, and bed carries over as saved.\n- The 26.2 line continues on the `26.2` branch; 26.1 on `26.1`.\n- Capture Net: if the standalone Capture Net mod is installed, use its 0.4.0+ build alongside this one."
		},
